+/* GIMP - The GNU Image Manipulation Program
+ * Copyright (C) 1995 Spencer Kimball and Peter Mattis
+ *
+ * chopgimp-global-colors-editor.c — ChopGimp 3.27.2 (lot V6 point 2): the
+ * « Couleurs globales » dockable, the document swatches of Illustrator
